373 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (A 3D printer is made up of several essential components that work in unison to create objects. Key parts include the print bed, where the object is built; the extruder and hot end, which melt and deposit material layer by layer; stepper motorsthat control movement along the X, Y, and Z axes; and a cooling fan that solidifies the printed material. The frameprovides structural support, while the power supply ensures proper functioning of the printer. Together, these components enable precise and efficient 3D printing from digital designs.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
