/T (AS OF NOW)
/E (AS OF NOW)
/Pg 19 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
465 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (3D printing has expanded its scope across a variety of industries, making a significant impact on both production processes and creative design. In manufacturing, 3D printers allow for rapid prototyping, enabling companies to create functional models quickly and test designs without the need for costly molds or tooling. This speeds up product development and reduces waste. In healthcare, 3D printing is being used to create custom prosthetics, implants, and anatomical models that help doctors with pre-surgical planning.)
/Pg 19 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
